card.statement:
Assume $q_i\neq 1$ for all $1 \le i \le n$. Let $\phi\in\widehat{R}$. Let $1 \le i \le n$ and let $k\in\Z^n$:

- the action of $x_i$ on $v_k$ is given by:

\begin{equation}
x_i . v_k
=
\left\{
\begin{array}{rcc}
\left(\displaystyle\prod_{1 \le j < i} \lambda_{ij}^{k_j} \right)v_{k+e_i} & \mbox{if} & k_i \ge 0, \cr
\displaystyle\frac{q_i^{-k_i}\phi(z_i)-1}{q_i-1} \left(\displaystyle\prod_{1 \le j < i} \lambda_{ij}^{k_j} \right)v_{k+e_i} & \mbox{if} & k_i < 0 ;
\end{array}
\right.
\end{equation}

- the action of $y_i$ on $v_k$ is given by:

\begin{equation}
y_i . v_k
= \left\{
\begin{array}{rcc}
\displaystyle\frac{q_i^{-k_i+1}\phi(z_i)-1}{q_i-1} \left(\displaystyle\prod_{1 \le j < i} \lambda_{ij}^{k_j} \right)^{-1}v_{k-e_i} & \mbox{if} & k_i > 0, \cr
\left(\displaystyle\prod_{1 \le j < i} \lambda_{ij}^{k_j} \right)^{-1}v_{k-e_i} & \mbox{if} & k_i \le 0.
\end{array}
\right.
\end{equation}
